Collect `req_transport_retries_exceeded` and `req_rnr_retries_exceeded`. These record retry exhaustion on a queue pair and sit in the same driver counter group as the errors already collected.

Log the difference between configured counter names and the files actually present in sysfs, at debug level. A counter name that matches no file previously produced no metric, no warning and no error, which made it indistinguishable from hardware that does not expose the counter.
